# Where a level link fires, part two: the cross-axis of the rectangle link in lv_a.nw
# (lv_c 10 28 2 5). Down and Up from different columns, Left and Right from
# different rows, so the box the client tests can be bounded on both axes.
start lv_a.nw 30.00 30.50
wait 3
mark n1-Down-8.0_20.0
chat warpto 8.0 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark n2-Down-8.5_20.0
chat warpto 8.5 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
mark n3-Down-9.0_20.0
chat warpto 9.0 20.0 lv_a.nw
wait 2
click 500 300
wait 0.5
hold Down 1.2
wait 1
